          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ventilō is built on ventulus 'a slight wind' (EtymDB; Lewis & Short), a diminutive of ventus 'wind'. English ventilate comes from it."
            }
          ]
        },
