              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "stipula, stipulae — \"a stalk, a straw; stubble\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Post messem in agrō sōla stipula manet. After the harvest only stubble is left in the field."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "First declension, feminine: stipula, stipulae f., a diminutive linked with stīpes 'stake'."
            }
          ]
        },
