            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Frūmentum in horreō servātur. The grain is kept in the granary."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Second declension, neuter: horreum, horreī n. Big public horrea by the river stored the city's grain."
            }
